<title>SINGAPORE: SingTel renames mobile phone, pager units.</title>
<headline>SingTel renames mobile phone, pager units.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Telecommunications Ltd (SingTel) will rename two of its subsidiaries from January 13, a company statement said on Saturday.</p>
<p>SingTel's mobile telephone unit, MobileLink, would be renamed SingTel Mobile, while its paging unit, PageLink, would be renamed SingTel Paging.</p>
<p>&quot;The change is...to make the names more catchy,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
